-- title:
--   Fixed field of the Γ₀(M') level automorphisms at level qℓ
-- statement:
--   Let $q\ge 5$ and $\ell\ge 3$ be primes with $\ell\neq q$, let $M'\ge 1$ be divisible by neither $q$ nor $\ell$, let $L$ be a field of characteristic zero, let $\xi\in L$ be a primitive $(q\ell)$-th root of unity, and assume there is a ring homomorphism $\iota:L\to\mathbb{C}$ with $\iota(\xi)=e^{2\pi i/(q\ell)}$. Let $K$ be the intermediate field of $L\subset L(\!(q)\!)$ obtained by adjoining to $L$ the coefficientwise image of $F_H=$ the subfield of $\mathbb{Q}(\!(q)\!)$ generated by the quotients $p_f/p_g$ of integral $q$-expansions of modular forms of equal weight for $\Gamma_H(N_0)$, where $N_0=(q\ell)^2M'$ and $H\le(\mathbb{Z}/N_0)^\times$ is the kernel of reduction to $(\mathbb{Z}/q\ell)^\times$. Write $\mathrm{qExpand}_{q\ell}$ for the ring homomorphism of $L(\!(q)\!)$ multiplying all exponents by $q\ell$, and $F_0$ for the corresponding base change to $L$ of the $q$-expansion field of $\Gamma_0(M')$. Then: (1) $\mathrm{qExpand}_{q\ell}(x)\in K$ for every $x\in F_0$; and (2) an element $w\in K$ satisfies $\tau w=w$ for every $\gamma\in\Gamma_0(M')$ and every $L$-algebra automorphism $\tau$ of $K$ satisfying the predicate `IsLevelAutAt` at $\gamma^{-1}$ with data $(q\ell,\xi,q\ell,N_0,H)$ — that is, $\tau$ transforms quotients of integral $q$-expansions of forms of level $\Gamma_H(N_0)$, read through any such $\iota$, according to the slash action of $\bigl(\begin{smallmatrix}a&b/(q\ell)\\ (q\ell)c&d\end{smallmatrix}\bigr)$ — if and only if $w=\mathrm{qExpand}_{q\ell}(x)$ for some $x\in F_0$.
--
--   This identifies the subfield of the level-$(q\ell)^2M'$ $q$-expansion field cut out by the level automorphisms attached to $\Gamma_0(M')$ as the $\Gamma_0(M')$-layer read in the variable $q^{q\ell}$, the Galois-theoretic description of the covering $X_H((q\ell)^2M')\to X_0(M')$ in terms of $q$-expansions, with general coefficient field $L$ in place of a cyclotomic one. It feeds the maximality and density statements used to pin down the image of the classifying map on $\Gamma_0$-data.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_FullLevel_AuxLevel_forall_isLevelAutAt_apply_eq_iff_exists_eq_qExpand_gamma0_of_exists_ringHom.lean

